OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy but
OL,6,Fdry in the north, with a swathe of
OL,7,Frain across southern areas with some
OL,8,Fheavier spells possible here. The rain
OL,9,Fslowly edges away to the south to
OL,10,Fleave a cloudy but mostly dry end to
OL,11,Fthe night. Breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FWidely cloudy to start but
OL,14,Fany rain limited to the far south.
OL,15,FTurning partly cloudy with the odd
OL,16,Flight shower for northern coasts. Near
OL,17,Faverage by day, turning cold. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
